    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d153-a4-a9">

                <pb facs="0307" n="961" sameAs="frus:frus1875v02/pg961"/>

                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Office of
                            Inspector of Hides and Animals</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Zapata
                            County, Texas</hi>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>This is to certify that I have this day inspected, in possession of Toribio
                    Lozano, eight thousand (8,000) head of sheep and goats, of his own property,
                    marked as follows: <figure>
                        <graphic url="figure_0307"/>
                    </figure></p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">In testimony of which said inspection I extend
                        this certificate of protection, verifying the same by my signature hereto
                        subscribed and officially hereto attached at office in
                            <placeName>Carrizo</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-02-09">the 9th day of February, A. D. 1874</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>JOSHUA ARMSTRONG,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Inspector of Hides and
                            Animals, Zapata County, Texas.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
